                                        "entry_id": "88115318-7795-3f69-ab01-d0ca86ed390c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A manufacturing process using a mold."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4beaed9-f63d-3e09-8740-cced0b6bb8c1",
                                        "entry_id": "88115318-7795-3f69-ab01-d0ca86ed390c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object made in a mold."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d6e9d31-6cd1-49d8-aa5a-45e7da56c8a0",
                                                "sense_id": "f4beaed9-f63d-3e09-8740-cced0b6bb8c1",
                                                "text": "The practice of casting steel seems the most difficult of all the foundry arts, for despite every care, a percentage of the work is liable to be faulty and disappointing, but at Crewe, generally, a very good class of casting was turned out."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7483d336-bab9-3cc2-beff-0abc2990a85b",
                                        "entry_id": "88115318-7795-3f69-ab01-d0ca86ed390c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The regurgitation of fur, feathers, and other undigestible material by hawks, to clean and empty their crops.^([W])"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae5f2cba-9cb1-4a9a-b0c9-c9602f80c61c",
                                                "sense_id": "7483d336-bab9-3cc2-beff-0abc2990a85b",
                                                "text": "“What, ho! sir knave,” exclaimed Roland, “is it thus you feed the eyasse with unwashed meat, as if you were gorging the foul brancher of a worthless hoodie-crow, by the mass? and thou hast neglected its castings also for these two days.[…]”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b9c8680-eccc-3e98-82a7-651176cdb849",
                                        "entry_id": "88115318-7795-3f69-ab01-d0ca86ed390c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The excreta of an earthworm or similar creature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "47dcefa9-c273-3f59-9629-31a04d748e0a",
                                        "entry_id": "88115318-7795-3f69-ab01-d0ca86ed390c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of converting between data types."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48d79e6a-8231-35f3-8220-5c2c5fe67f67",
                                        "entry_id": "88115318-7795-3f69-ab01-d0ca86ed390c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of hounds, the act of spreading out and searching for a scent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d131e3f7-1da0-415e-8f11-a2f07160d763",
                                                "sense_id": "48d79e6a-8231-35f3-8220-5c2c5fe67f67",
                                                "text": "\"The dogs were no sooner let loose, than the hare was afoot. This time there was no stopping or casting, but the hounds were soon in full cry, and after half-an-hour's run, the hare came dancing down the moor towards me.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e121fac8-a959-47a3-90fa-efe19f93ace8",
                        "source_entry_id": "a53d5d5b-c22a-31ea-8589-780aa041103e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ec26d228-b6d8-3855-8900-4dc5ec700e12",
                        "source_sense_description": "Auswahlverfahren, um für eine bestimmte Aufgabe eine geeignete Person zu finden",
                        "target_lang_word": "casting",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "casting",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df64f448-699d-3903-ba6e-1341212270b0",
                                        "entry_id": "797a5f8c-b3dd-3a32-834b-d9685be6b91e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Recherche et choix des artistes (acteurs, danseurs, etc.) pour une production, on recommande le terme audition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb3d6135-c865-4132-a6f5-2ca70f03489d",
                                                "sense_id": "df64f448-699d-3903-ba6e-1341212270b0",
                                                "text": "Quand j’ai rendez-vous pour un casting, mon agent se débrouille toujours pour savoir de quoi il s’agit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ab47e15-9c60-4d58-8c46-3d494813eaa7",
                                                "sense_id": "df64f448-699d-3903-ba6e-1341212270b0",
                                                "text": "Les deux zigotos étaient les pistonnés de ce casting et Olivier Kader était le réalisateur en personne de ce spot.\nJean, toujours à genoux, les jambes douloureuses, assistait, impuissant, au trucage odieux de ce casting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16fd0207-9b96-4a36-9a73-73384239c741",
                                                "sense_id": "df64f448-699d-3903-ba6e-1341212270b0",
                                                "text": "Les émissions de télécrochet laissent beaucoup de place au « coach » vocal qui choisit des candidats lors d’un « casting ». Est-ce un appauvrissement de notre langue ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efcafe9f-146b-3a0e-84ca-9f9b075e19ed",
                                        "entry_id": "797a5f8c-b3dd-3a32-834b-d9685be6b91e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Distribution des rôles dans une production (film, théâtre etc.) ; on recommande le terme distribution artistique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b341927-355a-4117-9f1c-297ed53b1256",
                                                "sense_id": "efcafe9f-146b-3a0e-84ca-9f9b075e19ed",
                                                "text": "« C’est une fiction qui pousse les murs, à la fois en matière de production, de sujet, de casting et d'originalité du récit », selon Anne Viau, son homologue à TF1."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33a2339a-28cf-4414-8a17-a3c13bc01b14",
                                                "sense_id": "efcafe9f-146b-3a0e-84ca-9f9b075e19ed",
                                                "text": "Joséphine Draï complète ce casting en incarnant l’un des seuls personnages féminins de la série (lire l’encadré)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
